{"root":"akur","ipa":"/a.kur/","core":"和谐、一致、和睦，指人与人之间关系融洽或意见统一。","pos":["形容词"],"scenes":["高频","生活"],"rootBlock":{"ipa":"/a.kur/","zh":"和谐的，和睦的，意见一致的。","phrases":[{"t":"hidup akur","zh":"和睦相处"},{"t":"akur dengan teman","zh":"与朋友和睦相处"},{"t":"tidak akur","zh":"不和睦，有矛盾"}],"examples":[{"t":"Mereka hidup akur sebagai tetangga.","zh":"他们作为邻居和睦相处。"},{"t":"Meskipun berbeda pendapat, mereka tetap akur.","zh":"尽管意见不同，他们依然保持和睦。"}]},"ders":[{"w":"akur","ipa":"/a.kur/","zh":"和谐的，和睦的。","phrase":{"t":"selalu akur","zh":"总是很和睦"},"example":{"t":"Kakak beradik itu selalu akur.","zh":"那对兄弟姐妹总是很和睦。"}},{"w":"mengakuri","ipa":"/mə.ŋa.ku.ri/","zh":"同意，赞同，认可。","phrase":{"t":"mengakuri keputusan","zh":"同意该决定"},"example":{"t":"Ayah mengakuri rencana perjalanan kami.","zh":"父亲同意了我们的旅行计划。"}},{"w":"kerukunan","ipa":"/kə.ru.ku.nan/","zh":"和谐，和睦，融洽（名词）。","phrase":{"t":"menjaga kerukunan","zh":"维护和谐"},"example":{"t":"Kerukunan antarumat beragama sangat penting.","zh":"宗教间的和谐非常重要。"}},{"w":"rukun","ipa":"/ru.kun/","zh":"和睦的，和谐的（akur的同义词，更常用）。","phrase":{"t":"hidup rukun","zh":"和睦生活"},"example":{"t":"Keluarga mereka sangat rukun.","zh":"他们的家庭非常和睦。"}}],"derSlugs":["akur","mengakuri","kerukunan","rukun"],"model":"gemini-3.1-flash-lite","createdAt":"2026-10-01T02:13:43.483Z","src":"base"}